### ============================================================================
### NOTIFICATIONS ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Gestión de notificaciones

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1
@accessToken = your_jwt_token_here

### ============================================================================
### 1. GET /notifications - Get User Notifications
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene todas las notificaciones del usuario autenticado

GET {{@api}}/notifications?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with array of notifications:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "notifications": [
###     {
###       "id": "notif_12345",
###       "type": "transaction",
###       "title": "Purchase Completed",
###       "message": "You successfully purchased 100 GAPC tokens",
###       "read": false,
###       "createdAt": "2024-01-01T12:00:00Z"
###     },
###     ...
###   ]
### }


### ============================================================================
### 2. GET /notifications/unread - Get Unread Notifications Count
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene el número de notificaciones sin leer

GET {{@api}}/notifications/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "count": 5
### }


### ============================================================================
### 3. POST /notifications/:id/read - Mark Notification as Read
### ============================================================================
### Marca una notificación como leída

POST {{@api}}/notifications/notif_12345/read
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Response should be 200 OK


### ============================================================================
### 4. POST /notifications/read-all - Mark All as Read
### ============================================================================
### Marca todas las notificaciones como leídas

POST {{@api}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Response should be 200 OK


### ============================================================================
### 5. DELETE /notifications/:id - Delete Notification
### ============================================================================
### Elimina una notificación

DELETE {{@api}}/notifications/notif_12345
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK


### ============================================================================
### 6. DELETE /notifications - Delete All Notifications
### ============================================================================
### Elimina todas las notificaciones

DELETE {{@api}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK


### ============================================================================
### 7. POST /notifications/subscribe - Subscribe to Notifications
### ============================================================================
### Se suscribe a cierto tipo de notificaciones

POST {{@api}}/notifications/subscribe
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "types": ["transaction", "purchase", "withdrawal"],
  "email": true,
  "push": true,
  "inApp": true
}

### Response should be 200 OK


### ============================================================================
### 8. GET /notifications/preferences - Get Notification Preferences
### ============================================================================
### Obtiene preferencias de notificaciones

GET {{@api}}/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{@accessToken}}

### Response should be 200 OK with preferences

